<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f6f8; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1e293b;">PowerGridBD</h2>
      <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
      <p>Your email verification code is:</p>
      <p style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #2563eb; margin: 16px 0;"><%= otp %></p>
      <p>This code expires in 5 minutes.</p>
      <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 13px;">If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
